# Andalusia Water Stress and Reservoir Dashboard

## Core Instruction
Build the dashboard immediately.
Do not just describe the implementation.
Do not stop at planning.
Do not ask for missing backend details.
Use realistic mock data and complete the first working product version.

## Product Goal
Create a premium React dashboard for Andalusia water monitoring.
The product combines:
- reservoir KPIs
- drought and water stress indicators
- province-level monitoring
- temporal hydrology trends
- technical reservoir detail

This is not a generic admin template.
This is not a SaaS landing page.
This is a climate and water intelligence dashboard.

The expected structure follows the reference pattern:
- executive summary at the top
- one main reservoir evolution chart
- severity distribution
- province status section
- climate indicators
- technical reservoirs table

The attached reference dashboard follows this same sequence with top KPIs, reservoir evolution, severity distribution, province status, climate indicator blocks, and a final reservoirs table. [file:17]

