## Dashboard Sections

### 1. Header
Create `DashboardHeader` with:
- title: "Andalusia Water Dashboard"
- subtitle
- last updated text
- filter controls
- theme toggle

### 2. KPI Row
Create `KpiGrid` with 5 to 6 cards:
- Average Reservoir Fill
- Total Stored Water
- Water Stress Index
- Weekly Change
- Accumulated Rainfall
- Provinces in Emergency

Each KPI card supports:
- label
- value
- unit
- delta
- small trend
- optional severity chip

The reference dashboard clearly begins with an executive KPI summary including average reservoir capacity, SPI, rainfall, and provinces in emergency. [file:17]

### 3. Main Reservoir Evolution Chart
Create `ReservoirEvolutionChart`.

Requirements:
- line chart
- monthly trend
- multiple series if useful
- readable legend
- compact tooltip
- high emphasis in layout
- this is the main visual anchor

This corresponds to the central reservoir evolution block in the reference dashboard. [file:17]

### 4. Severity Distribution
Create `SeverityDistributionCard`.

Show:
